WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.250
i'm kyra in tally bar from the Finnish
unit of the language service and today

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:11.160
there is a summit going on. We are
translating the conclusions and other

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.379
documents produced by the European
Council. It's maybe the most motivating

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:22.020
part of our translation work, because we
are responsible for very important

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:27.480
political documents. We have to be really
at our best. Even normally we have quite

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:35.940
tight deadlines, but this is even tighter.
Every language has a little island like

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:42.690
this and translators and assistants work
together in it. We work on the screen or

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:48.329
on the paper, depends on the case. It's
really a team work and we discuss

00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:54.930
formulations, words, terms, all kinds of
things. We do research. It's really about

00:00:54.930 --> 00:01:00.629
knowing and sensing your own language,
and it's especially in important

00:01:00.629 --> 00:01:05.309
political documents as we translate here
the details have to be exactly right

00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:14.070
because words are also political. I very
much like translation work because it's

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:20.369
really striving for perfection and
knowing at the same time that perfection

00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:27.830
in translation is impossible but it's
nice to see how far you can get

